5,1,1,talk,Midori,,I want to ensure we have clear accountability and a plan that can adapt. I'll check support ownership during last winter's outage and warehouse rule changes after new accounts.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The depot floor is my priority. I will look into the depot calendar and the peak-season cutover, and yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'm wary of systems that rot or external work that fails. I'll examine the upgrade history of the dispatch tool and the data lift in the 2018 pay move.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"We need to consider the people. I'll review administrator retirements and hiring times, as well as depot supervisors and the last rollout.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I'm interested in the long-term financial trajectory. I shall examine the board minutes on capital and operating requests and five years of renewal invoices.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
